<!-- DATA NOTE FOR IDMC DATA -->
<section class = 'sonification-note'>
    <h2>// Data from the IDMC</h2>

    <p>Data for this sonification comes from  the <a href='https://www.internal-displacement.org/' target="_blank">Internal Displacement Monitoring Centre</a>. It contains annual data about the volume of people displaced internally &mdash; i.e. inside their own countries &mdash; by conflict and disaster events. Data is reported for 86 countries and areas, from 2008 to 2024, which equates to a timeframe 17 years. Data not reported in for some countries, for some years, is assumed to be zero. Data recorded on the volumes of annual displacement, cumulative 'stock' and number of disasters (by year) are used in the sonification. To suit musical timing, data has been rolled up to a maximum division of 16 steps/sixteenth notes (using a weighted binning algorithm).
    </p>

    <p>Each data <i>project</i> in this sonification represent different nation or area. The selected nation (i.e. <i>project</i>) is randomised on load, and can be updated/cycled through by the user.</p>
</section>

